  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "1 cup vegetable oil",
    "3 eggs",
    "0.5 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1.3333333730698 cups gluten-free all-purpose baking flour (such as Cup4Cup™)",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking powder",
    "1.5 teaspoons baking soda",
    "1.5 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups grated carrots",
    "0.5 (8 ounce) package cream cheese",
    "0.25 cup butter, softened",
    "2 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ycApu9sCLb_CjYYzga7Zrsov4fs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-001-step-01-2ff1d679e67349e5aa5c1f801f6d4784.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the carrot cake: Beat sugar and oil together in a bowl using an electric mixer until smooth and creamy. Beat in eggs one at a time, mixing well after each addition. Stir in vanilla.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5r95uWan4eil809FiolA_By1VYk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-003-step-02-01-35a06185f68348e8ab506452d4a6674d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine baking flour, baking powder, baking soda, cinnamon, and salt in a separate bowl; beat into egg mixture until batter is smooth. Fold in carrots until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TKH6Sva1SOCCb8n79EmYdougv7A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-004-step-03-a02084d425f54c838011ddd994bfa343.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zr8UeYVaynkdFy8nkwrQ5KNW9Kk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-005-step-04-73893c9ff291447db2d2cbfc95a50dff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 35 minutes. Allow cake to cool completely for at least 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ezhw_KESqzSE9MqOFu6uNEEM7EA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-006-step-05-ffa55f5a881b4565b1eaf9cca1b881d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the icing: Beat cream cheese and butter together in a bowl using an electric mixer until well combined. Beat in confectioners' sugar, a little at a time, until icing is smooth and creamy. Add vanilla and beat well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4vWlNp8nJgb4UnDzWKWexOgbgnc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-007-step-06-01-0fd3a3d33e5c4391aaf7d71f21d11aff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread icing onto cooled cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_WFh1e_MBeCQNrcFoyDQ7IyPNd0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-009-step-07-d13eea22ba904c1c9119fecb960e6529.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pFJ2wW725QzD8J4AjiPhJNQkYWo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/257905-easy-gluten-free-carrot-cake-VAT-010-step-08-59bf16e825224205b87008fcd754fc1a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/257905/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
